</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, December 16, 2004 - 11:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This is for any comments about the &#34;MESSAGES from BTK&#34; thread that don&#39;t fit in the neighbooring &#34;MESSAGES to BTK&#34; thread. De-coding of his messages, strategies for catching him, etc. <BR> <BR>Let&#39;s hear it! Victor<!--/Text--></td></tr>
