<!--Post: 2084--><!--Time: 1103306372-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2084"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->hmmm<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 17, 2004 - 9:59 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I just noticed that most of the BTK messages are around the same time. <BR>DEC 7 4:54 <BR>DEC 9 4:32 <BR>DEC 14 4:43 <BR>DEC 16 4:57 <BR>Also none were on weekends, all weekdays. <BR>Is he checking out the site after work? Maybe stopping by an intenet cafe before going home?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
