<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2119"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 17, 2004 - 2:43 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If you search google.com for  4B3530...   you get this weired picture!: <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.google.dk/search?q=cache:ivTcQvOlWuEJ:rlc.hal-9000.net/messages/1/7/17002.html%2B4B3530%2B&amp;hl=en" target=_top>http://www.google.dk/search?q=cache:ivTcQvOlWuEJ:r lc.hal-9000.net/messages/1/7/17002.html&#43;4B3530&#43;&amp;hl =en</a> <BR> <BR>when you search 5A4B43 you get this site <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.google.dk/search?q=cache:2B9fIWIkomoJ:forum.tt-hardware.com/ultimatebb.cgi%3Fubb%3Dreply%26f%3D15%26t%3D005032%26replyto%3D000000%2B5A4B43&amp;hl=en" target=_top>http://www.google.dk/search?q=cache:2B9fIWIkomoJ:f orum.tt-hardware.com/ultimatebb.cgi%3Fubb%3Dreply% 26f%3D15%26t%3D005032%26replyto%3D000000&#43;5A4B43&amp;hl =en</a> <BR> <BR>Apparently they are both som kind of picture/color codes, but who knows if BTK has anything to do with it? <BR> <BR>Maybe we should note the NAME of the girl in the picture &#34;ASCII Rachael&#34; ??? <BR> <BR>hugs...skov<!--/Text--></td></tr>
