<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2120"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Somerset<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 17, 2004 - 2:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Re: ASCII Rachael! - William 02:53:28 9/14/2001 &#40;0&#41; <BR> <BR>It&#39;s intersting that William is short for Bill.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
